+        "states, so a solver can quotient millions of vertex updates by the finite "
+        "subtree grammar."
+    ),
+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track B: Theorem 5.2 proves that Algorithm 1 computes cc_k(T) for odd k "
+        "in O(N) time on an explicit N-vertex tree; at the shipping preset the "
+        "expanded reference run and its exact operation count are measured in G5/G6, "
+        "whereas quotienting by repeated subtree type uses fewer than 300 exact "
+        "integer additions."
