   398	the variables admit a Not-All-Equal satisfiable assignment of $\phi$.
   399	
   400	Suppose that $\phi$ is satisfiable. Given a Not-All-Equal satisfiable assignment on variables $x_1,x_2, \cdots x_n$, \
   401	we color the graph $G$ as follows.
   402	
   403	If $x_i=0$, then the edges incident with the vertex $t_{i,1}$ are colored with 1 and the edges incident with the
