codex
The finalized local artifact is now fast enough for routine grading: the 200,000-candidate gate dropped to 9.65 seconds after caching only derived parity positions, while `verify` still reconstructs and checks the full NAE assignment for any parity-valid candidate. All gates pass again, including DPLL as the required domain-standard Track B reference. I’m doing the final interface, determinism, and deliverable audit now.
